# TapeOut Protocol -- chain task #260 (bank 293) 4-bit + 8-bit concatenated carry add
# S[8:0] = B[7:0] + A[3:0]   (A zero-extended)
# variant V3 (minimum-C / depth-optimised) / pin order B_first
# gates=83 depth=8 C=A*d^3=42,496 C_ref=14,656,250 ratio=345x q=4.0(capped)
# H(P=1)=3835  H(P=6)=23010  burn=83 NAND
# Key identities: (1) g<=p absorption => ~G(i:j)=NAND(p_i,NAND(~g_i,~G(i-1:j)))
#                 (2) c4=(G32+P32)&(G32+G10) puts an AND last, so ~c4 lands a level early
# NAND-only, zero dead gates, outputs are the LAST 9 gates in LSB->MSB order.
# Exhaustively verified over all 4096 input vectors.
